{"content": {"children": [{"props": {"children": "技术指标 · 2026-11-23"}, "type": "H2", "namespace": "dash_html_components"}, {"props": {"children": "以下只做技术对照，不作为投资建议。一律使用主力连续合约（RU0 / NR0 / BR0），不用单月份合约口径。日线指标按 11 月 20 日已完成日K（19 日夜盘 + 20 日日盘）计算。11 月 20 日 21:00–23:00 夜盘已走完、归属今天（23 日）交易日，但今日日K尚未收盘，夜盘仅作早盘参考，不纳入日线指标。盘后会再出一版替换。", "className": "notice"}, "type": "P", "namespace": "dash_html_components"}, {"props": {"children": "来源：橡胶技术指标推送者。价格序列：新浪财经主力连续合约日K，收盘、结算、成交与持仓以上期所、上期能源 2026-11-20 日交易快讯为准，与主力月份 RU2701 / NR2701 / BR2701 一致。夜盘参考已与新浪连续/主力 23:00 盘口及 1 分钟分时交叉核对。TradingView 额外三项今日复核仍为 SMC（LuxAlgo，183373）、Squeeze Momentum（LazyBear，118507）、SuperTrend（KivancOzbilgic，86147）。第 4 名为多重时间框架 MACD，与已列入的 MACD 重复，不替换前三项。MACD 为 12/26/9，柱口径 2×(DIF−DEA)。均线为 SMA。", "className": "muted tech-source"}, "type": "P", "namespace": "dash_html_components"}, {"props": {"children": [{"props": {"children": "总体结论"}, "type": "H2", "namespace": "dash_html_components"}, {"props": {"children": [{"props": {"children": "天然橡胶 RU（主力 RU2701，连续合约 RU0）："}, "type": "Strong", "namespace": "dash_html_components"}, "偏空。日K收 18625，回抽 18915 失败，最低 18325 已跌破中枢下沿 18600 和前低参考 18360，收盘仍略高于 18600；MACD 死叉后绿柱扩大。夜盘参考最低 18100、收 18180，已运行于 18600、18360 之下，日K尚未收盘确认。"], "style": {"whiteSpace": "pre-wrap", "lineHeight": "1.9"}}, "type": "P", "namespace": "dash_html_components"}, {"props": {"children": [{"props": {"children": "20号胶 NR（主力 NR2701，连续合约 NR0）："}, "type": "Strong", "namespace": "dash_html_components"}, "偏空。日K收 15795，回抽 16020 失败，最低 15525 已跌破大中枢下沿 15745，收盘仍高于 15745；MACD 死叉后绿柱扩大。夜盘参考最低 15235、收 15325，已跌破 15745 和 15435，仍属未完成日K。"], "style": {"whiteSpace": "pre-wrap", "lineHeight": "1.9"}}, "type": "P", "namespace": "dash_html_components"}, {"props": {"children": [{"props": {"children": "丁二烯橡胶 BR（主力 BR2701，连续合约 BR0）："}, "type": "Strong", "namespace": "dash_html_components"}, "震荡（中性），短线仍偏弱。日K收 15560、结算 15590，低点 15390 守住中枢下沿 15285，收盘已收复 MA60 / MA10；但 MACD 死叉未修复，DEA 已落到零轴下方，SuperTrend / Squeeze 仍偏空。夜盘参考最低 15180、收 15230，重新贴近并一度跌破 15285，不能据此改写日线结构。"], "style": {"whiteSpace": "pre-wrap", "lineHeight": "1.9"}}, "type": "P", "namespace": "dash_html_components"}, {"props": {"children": "RU、NR 日线维持偏空，已完成日K收盘仍分别高于中枢下沿 18600、15745；BR 日线维持震荡（中性）、短线仍偏弱，已完成日K守住 15285。夜盘 RU、NR 已运行于相应日线关键位之下，BR 重新贴近并一度跌破 15285，但今日日K尚未收盘，不能据此改写日线结构。", "style": {"whiteSpace": "pre-wrap", "lineHeight": "1.9"}}, "type": "P", "namespace": "dash_html_components"}], "className": "panel"}, "type": "Div", "namespace": "dash_html_components"}, {"props": {"children": [{"props": {"children": [{"props": {"children": "天然橡胶 RU（主力连续合约）"}, "type": "H2", "namespace": "dash_html_components"}, {"props": {"children": "偏空", "className": "tech-bias tech-bias-down"}, "type": "Span", "namespace": "dash_html_components"}], "className": "tech-variety-head"}, "type": "Div", "namespace": "dash_html_components"}, {"props": {"children": [{"props": {"children": [{"props": {"children": "日K收盘"}, "type": "Small", "namespace": "dash_html_components"}, {"props": {"children": "18625"}, "type": "Strong", "namespace": "dash_html_components"}, {"props": {"children": "11 月 20 日已完成日K"}, "type": "Span", "namespace": "dash_html_components"}], "className": "kpi tech-kpi"}, "type": "Div", "namespace": "dash_html_components"}, {"props": {"children": [{"props": {"children": "夜盘收"}, "type": "Small", "namespace": "dash_html_components"}, {"props": {"children": "18180"}, "type": "Strong", "namespace": "dash_html_components"}, {"props": {"children": "仅作早盘参考，不纳入日线指标"}, "type": "Span", "namespace": "dash_html_components"}], "className": "kpi tech-kpi"}, "type": "Div", "namespace": "dash_html_components"}, {"props": {"children": [{"props": {"children": "倾向"}, "type": "Small", "namespace": "dash_html_components"}, {"props": {"children": "偏空"}, "type": "Strong", "namespace": "dash_html_components"}, {"props": {"children": ""}, "type": "Span", "namespace": "dash_html_components"}], "className": "kpi tech-kpi"}, "type": "Div", "namespace": "dash_html_components"}, {"props": {"child